# The tools the Code audit workflow (audit.yml) installs without the rest of the
# development set: ruff, import-linter, mypy with django-stubs, and pip-audit.
#
# This is the source: edit it, then run scripts/compile_requirements.sh, which
# writes .github/requirements/ci-tools.txt from it with every package's hashes (pip-compile from pip-tools;
# commit both). Never edit .github/requirements/ci-tools.txt by hand. pip then installs only files whose
# hash matches (MAINTENANCE.md, "Hash-checked installs").
#
# Constrained to requirements-dev.txt: the same versions as in the devcontainer.
-c ../../requirements-dev.txt

ruff
import-linter
mypy
django-stubs
django-stubs-ext
types-PyYAML
pip-audit
